1- Lacks players;
2- Like almost every other game attempting to follow this idea there are crucial balancing problems. In this case Dinosaurs players will feel like the maps were made with soft patches to let them also play there, which translates to a very frustrating experience;
3- Expecting a mesh of both races in the two teams I was rather disappointed finding out that one faction is almost exclusively Dinosaurs and the other pretty weak, which taking 2 into account pretty much screws the balance of the entire game.
Interesting in concept, but it ends up failing due to bad environment design.
